Subject: [PATCH 6/9] Make upstream source checks self-contained

Apply the current Ruff mechanical fixes to the example client, route its MCP result fields through the SDK compatibility boundary, install the declared lint/docutils typing tools, and point Mypy at the existing project configuration.
